# The engine's two secrets. The Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for them; `npm run setup` makes them for you.
# ENC_KEY: any long random text (40 or more characters). It encrypts the keys your engine keeps.
ENC_KEY=
# ADMIN_KEY: a password you choose (20 or more characters). You type it once, on the setup page, to make the engine yours.
ADMIN_KEY=
